WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.849 --> 00:00:13.436
Poor Geppetto was locked in prison.

2
00:00:14.457 --> 00:00:16.819
But Pinocchio was laughing and running through the forest.

3
00:00:17.479 --> 00:00:19.921
Pinocchio wasn't wearing clothes, and he didn't care.

4
00:00:19.941 --> 00:00:25.245
"I'm free, I'm free," he shouted as he ran.

5
00:00:25.265 --> 00:00:28.348
"I can run and leap and play!"

6
00:00:30.188 --> 00:00:32.730
The sun began to set, and Pinocchio was getting tired.

7
00:00:33.331 --> 00:00:34.892
So he returned to Geppetto's house.

8
00:00:34.912 --> 00:00:39.296
"I'm hungry," he said, and he searched the house for food.

9
00:00:39.756 --> 00:00:42.619
But Pinocchio didn't know how to cook, so he couldn't eat.

10
00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:49.604
"I'm cold," he said, and he searched the house for clothes.

11
00:00:50.185 --> 00:00:53.367
But Pinocchio had run away before Geppetto could make him any clothes.

12
00:00:54.068 --> 00:00:55.509
So he wrapped himself in a blanket.

13
00:00:55.529 --> 00:01:00.993
"I'm tired," he said, but Geppetto's bed was too tall.

14
00:01:07.877 --> 00:01:08.797
Pinocchio cried.

15
00:01:08.817 --> 00:01:16.241
"I am cold and hungry and tired, and there is no one here to take care of me!"

16
00:01:17.322 --> 00:01:19.343
Big tears ran down his wooden face.

17
00:01:19.363 --> 00:01:25.726
"Well, if you hadn't been a bad boy, Geppetto would be here," said a tiny voice.

18
00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:28.228
"Who's there?"

19
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.561
asked Pinocchio, a little scared.

20
00:01:31.462 --> 00:01:33.343
Night was falling and the room was getting dark.

21
00:01:33.904 --> 00:01:35.325
Pinocchio couldn't see anyone.

22
00:01:36.425 --> 00:01:39.608
"I am," said the voice again, with a chirping sound.

23
00:01:40.468 --> 00:01:42.550
A small candle on the table suddenly lit up.

24
00:01:44.151 --> 00:01:46.352
Pinocchio saw a cricket crawling down the candle.

25
00:01:48.454 --> 00:01:49.975
"Oh! You're a bug!"

26
00:01:50.475 --> 00:01:51.196
said Pinocchio.

27
00:01:51.216 --> 00:01:52.496
"Who are you?"

28
00:01:52.516 --> 00:01:55.058
"My name is Mick the Cricket.

29
00:01:55.659 --> 00:01:56.439
You may call me Mr.

30
00:01:56.519 --> 00:02:01.026
Cricket. I have lived in this room for one hundred years.

31
00:02:01.527 --> 00:02:04.549
But I have never seen such a bad boy as you!"

32
00:02:05.269 --> 00:02:05.870
he scolded.

33
00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.852
"I don't like you either!"

34
00:02:09.493 --> 00:02:10.253
said Pinocchio.

35
00:02:10.814 --> 00:02:13.195
He was mad at the cricket for calling him a bad boy.

36
00:02:13.215 --> 00:02:16.138
"Shame on you for being rude!"

37
00:02:16.558 --> 00:02:17.258
chirped the cricket.

38
00:02:17.278 --> 00:02:22.002
"I am trying to help you, and Geppetto has been very kind.

39
00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.544
Is this how you thank your friends?

40
00:02:25.816 --> 00:02:28.559
If so, you will have very bad friends.

41
00:02:29.219 --> 00:02:32.622
Children should honor their parents, and you have not!"

42
00:02:33.443 --> 00:02:35.144
Pinocchio banged his hand on the table.

43
00:02:35.965 --> 00:02:37.266
He was trying to squash Mr.

44
00:02:37.286 --> 00:02:40.509
Cricket! "I'll show you!

45
00:02:40.529 --> 00:02:43.412
I can have all the friends I want!"

46
00:02:43.852 --> 00:02:44.813
Pinocchio screamed.

47
00:02:45.453 --> 00:02:47.395
"I can do whatever I want!

48
00:02:47.936 --> 00:02:49.797
I don't have to honor anyone!

49
00:02:50.478 --> 00:02:52.620
I am going to go on adventures.

50
00:02:53.416 --> 00:02:55.979
One day, I will be rich and famous!"

51
00:02:56.959 --> 00:02:58.961
Mr. Cricket jumped to the floor to run away.

52
00:02:59.782 --> 00:03:01.944
But Pinocchio chased him and tried to step on him.

53
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:05.887
"You are making very bad choices!"

54
00:03:06.287 --> 00:03:06.908
said the cricket.

55
00:03:06.928 --> 00:03:09.910
"One day those bad choices will hurt you.

56
00:03:10.611 --> 00:03:13.153
You can't run away from the choices you've made.

57
00:03:13.854 --> 00:03:19.298
You must learn to do honest work and study to be a good boy," he chirped, and he

58
00:03:19.398 --> 00:03:20.319
ran toward the door.

59
00:03:23.948 --> 00:03:24.828
"I won't work.

60
00:03:25.288 --> 00:03:26.289
I won't study.

61
00:03:26.809 --> 00:03:28.929
I won't listen to what you say!

62
00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:32.310
I will do only what I want!"

63
00:03:32.731 --> 00:03:33.591
Pinocchio screamed.

64
00:03:34.411 --> 00:03:35.931
Mr. Cricket ran under the door.

65
00:03:36.712 --> 00:03:37.772
Pinocchio kicked the door.

66
00:03:38.652 --> 00:03:41.593
He walked over to the table, sat down, and started to cry.

67
00:03:47.135 --> 00:03:51.816
won't listen to you or anyone else," he cried.

68
00:03:52.737 --> 00:03:55.154
He fell asleep with teardrops dripping off his nose.
